{"3086590": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Gods, Death & Reapers", "steam_appid": 3086590, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<h1>Roadmap</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3086590/extras/2b0f6c48bf170d94150cfff6a71bd4a5.avif?t=1785332032\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3086590/extras_big/2b0f6c48bf170d94150cfff6a71bd4a5.avif?t=1785332032 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3086590/extras/f2964e96013a89c9f8b16ea20be0a9d0.poster.avif?t=1785332032\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3086590/extras/f2964e96013a89c9f8b16ea20be0a9d0.webm?t=1785332032\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3086590/extras/f2964e96013a89c9f8b16ea20be0a9d0.mp4?t=1785332032\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a post-apocalyptic dark fantasy world, mythologies lie in ruins. This blend of Extraction and Action RPG challenges you to restore balance to the shattered realms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruited by Death, you’ll enter dangerous maps, complete objectives, fight enemies or other players, and secure your loot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3086590/extras/dd64ad5368986feebcf301bc30d362aa.poster.avif?t=1785332032\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3086590/extras/dd64ad5368986feebcf301bc30d362aa.webm?t=1785332032\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3086590/extras/dd64ad5368986feebcf301bc30d362aa.mp4?t=1785332032\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Journey through mythological realms, beginning with Norse mythology. Face tough enemies, take on quests, and gather powerful gear and artifacts. Master different playstyles in a fair game environment with strict anti-cheat tools. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3086590/extras/411c87babed7b42282858ff845789a57.poster.avif?t=1785332032\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3086590/extras/411c87babed7b42282858ff845789a57.webm?t=1785332032\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3086590/extras/411c87babed7b42282858ff845789a57.mp4?t=1785332032\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start from your hidden fortress, where you upgrade your base, customize loadouts, and prepare for battle. Each map offers unique objectives and treasures, but the stakes are high: die and lose everything, or extract and keep your rewards. Future updates will add new maps, player-to-player trading, and more ways to play!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3086590/extras/6abebc9bcee1a973af70cdad49fb0b9c.poster.avif?t=1785332032\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3086590/extras/6abebc9bcee1a973af70cdad49fb0b9c.webm?t=1785332032\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3086590/extras/6abebc9bcee1a973af70cdad49fb0b9c.mp4?t=1785332032\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alongside the high-stakes Reaper-vs-Reaper-vs-Environment extraction, you’ll get more ways to match your playstyle. PvE maps let you uncover the mystery of the dead gods at your own pace, without risking your gear. Or choose to play in a party, which will allow you to team up to fight factions and uncover more of the story after taking the first steps into the afterlife. The party system will be added in an upcoming update.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3086590/extras/abaca4c362461c0207d63206f8c8498e.poster.avif?t=1785332032\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3086590/extras/abaca4c362461c0207d63206f8c8498e.webm?t=1785332032\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3086590/extras/abaca4c362461c0207d63206f8c8498e.mp4?t=1785332032\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the Respawn mechanic, Death grants you a second chance. After dying for the first time, you can reclaim your own corpse or possess another fallen Reaper’s body to attend to your unfinished business in the afterlife.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3086590/extras/c0b1e457b8e27d6263400bb9ed7dedd4.poster.avif?t=1785332032\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3086590/extras/c0b1e457b8e27d6263400bb9ed7dedd4.webm?t=1785332032\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3086590/extras/c0b1e457b8e27d6263400bb9ed7dedd4.mp4?t=1785332032\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built with players in mind, we’re committed to community-driven development and real feedback. Closed Alpha testers help refine the game and shape its future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want to take part? Join our Discord to stay updated and share your ideas.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3086590/extras/f2964e96013a89c9f8b16ea20be0a9d0.poster.avif?t=1785332032\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3086590/extras/f2964e96013a89c9f8b16ea20be0a9d0.webm?t=1785332032\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3086590/extras/f2964e96013a89c9f8b16ea20be0a9d0.mp4?t=1785332032\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a post-apocalyptic dark fantasy world, mythologies lie in ruins. This blend of Extraction and Action RPG challenges you to restore balance to the shattered realms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruited by Death, you’ll enter dangerous maps, complete objectives, fight enemies or other players, and secure your loot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3086590/extras/dd64ad5368986feebcf301bc30d362aa.poster.avif?t=1785332032\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3086590/extras/dd64ad5368986feebcf301bc30d362aa.webm?t=1785332032\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3086590/extras/dd64ad5368986feebcf301bc30d362aa.mp4?t=1785332032\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Journey through mythological realms, beginning with Norse mythology. Face tough enemies, take on quests, and gather powerful gear and artifacts. Master different playstyles in a fair game environment with strict anti-cheat tools. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3086590/extras/411c87babed7b42282858ff845789a57.poster.avif?t=1785332032\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3086590/extras/411c87babed7b42282858ff845789a57.webm?t=1785332032\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3086590/extras/411c87babed7b42282858ff845789a57.mp4?t=1785332032\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start from your hidden fortress, where you upgrade your base, customize loadouts, and prepare for battle. Each map offers unique objectives and treasures, but the stakes are high: die and lose everything, or extract and keep your rewards. Future updates will add new maps, player-to-player trading, and more ways to play!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3086590/extras/6abebc9bcee1a973af70cdad49fb0b9c.poster.avif?t=1785332032\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3086590/extras/6abebc9bcee1a973af70cdad49fb0b9c.webm?t=1785332032\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3086590/extras/6abebc9bcee1a973af70cdad49fb0b9c.mp4?t=1785332032\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alongside the high-stakes Reaper-vs-Reaper-vs-Environment extraction, you’ll get more ways to match your playstyle. PvE maps let you uncover the mystery of the dead gods at your own pace, without risking your gear. Or choose to play in a party, which will allow you to team up to fight factions and uncover more of the story after taking the first steps into the afterlife. The party system will be added in an upcoming update.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3086590/extras/abaca4c362461c0207d63206f8c8498e.poster.avif?t=1785332032\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3086590/extras/abaca4c362461c0207d63206f8c8498e.webm?t=1785332032\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3086590/extras/abaca4c362461c0207d63206f8c8498e.mp4?t=1785332032\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the Respawn mechanic, Death grants you a second chance. After dying for the first time, you can reclaim your own corpse or possess another fallen Reaper’s body to attend to your unfinished business in the afterlife.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3086590/extras/c0b1e457b8e27d6263400bb9ed7dedd4.poster.avif?t=1785332032\" width=1170 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3086590/extras/c0b1e457b8e27d6263400bb9ed7dedd4.webm?t=1785332032\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3086590/extras/c0b1e457b8e27d6263400bb9ed7dedd4.mp4?t=1785332032\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built with players in mind, we’re committed to community-driven development and real feedback. Closed Alpha testers help refine the game and shape its future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want to take part? Join our Discord to stay updated and share your ideas.</p>", "short_description": "An innovative ExtrAction RPG set in an afterlife where mythology is real and the gods are dead. Fight through PvPvE, PvE, or as a party to claim valuable loot and bring balance to the shattered realms.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Japanese, Korean, Simplified Chinese, Thai, French, Italian, Spanish - Spain, Portuguese - Brazil, Spanish - Latin America, Traditional Chinese, German, Polish, Russian, Ukrainian<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3086590/bf7fdf0fadfd0669380c0b00aad9184d14092419/header.jpg?t=1785332032", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3086590/abfb89a87529e580d97505